# "When that creature dies this turn, create a 2/2 white and blue Detective creature token." The delayed ability's source is
# Felonious Rage, the instant that made it (CR 603.7d), not the creature it watches. So with it on the stack after the Memnite
# (an artifact creature) dies to Lightning Bolt, Echo, Perceptive Prodigy - "copy target activated or triggered ability you
# control from a creature source" - has nothing to target (a refusal, with the Mox Sapphire's mana for its {1}), and the one
# Detective is made. The positive control, a creature's own trigger copied, is Echo's own scenarios.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Echo, Perceptive Prodigy
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Memnite
Felonious Rage
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

